  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\quad y(x)=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\\sin x & \\cos x & \\sin x+\\cos x+1 \\\\ 27 & 28 & 27 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right|, x \\in \\mathbb{R}$, then $\\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}+y$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
