  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & C_3 \\rightarrow C_3-C_1 \\\\ & y(x)=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\\sin x & \\cos x & 1+\\cos x \\\\ 27 & 28 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right| \\\\ & y(x)=-(1+\\cos x) \\\\ & \\frac{d y}{d x}=\\sin x \\\\ & \\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}=\\cos x \\\\ & \\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}+y=-1\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
